---
title: The Bishop's Blessing
type: prayer
citation: BCP 523
bishop: true
bulletin: full
---

[Rubric] *The Bishop blesses the people, first saying*
[Bishop] Our help is in the Name of the Lord;
[People] **The maker of heaven and earth.**
[Bishop] Blessed be the Name of the Lord;
[People] **From this time forth for evermore.**
[Bishop] The blessing, mercy, and grace of God Almighty,
    the Father, the Son, and the Holy Spirit, be upon you, and remain with you for ever.
[People] **Amen.**
